<title>ECUADOR: Ecuador bank liquidity up 0.62 pct in wk to Dec 6.</title>
<headline>Ecuador bank liquidity up 0.62 pct in wk to Dec 6.</headline>
<dateline>QUITO 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecuador's Central Bank said Monday liquidity in the banking system grew 0.62 percent, or 102 million sucres, to 16.41 billion sucres in the week to December 6.</p>
<p>At the end of November, bank liquidity stood at 16.31 billion sucres.</p>
<p>Total liquidity in the bank sector ended 1995 at 12.51 billion sucres, up 41.2 percent from 1994.</p>
<p>-- Gustavo Oviedo, Quito Newsroom, 5932 258433</p>
</text>
